ill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">B</text><text x=\"151.20\" y=\"28.80\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">D</text><text x=\"111.60\" y=\"21.60\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">I</text><text x=\"111.60\" y=\"57.60\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">J</text><text x=\"28.80\" y=\"144.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">K</text><text x=\"72.00\" y=\"145.80\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">L</text><defs><marker id=\"ah22\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"10.0\" markerHeight=\"10.0\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" fill=\"#000000\" /></marker></defs><line x1=\"43.20\" y1=\"28.80\" x2=\"64.80\" y2=\"28.80\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"3.0\" marker-end=\"url(#ah22)\" /><defs><marker id=\"ah24\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"10.0\" markerHeight=\"10.0\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" fill=\"#000000\" /></marker></defs><line x1=\"28.80\" y1=\"43.20\" x2=\"28.80\" y2=\"64.80\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"3.0\" marker-end=\"url(#ah24)\" /></svg></span></div>\t</div>\t<div class=\"wims_question\">\t<label for=\"reply8\">Combien y a-t-il de trajets possibles ? </label> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply8\" data-size=\"4\"></span></div>\tOn suppose par la suite que les trajets sont équiprobables.\t<p>\tLe passage du pion par I rapporte  4 points,  par J rapporte  3 points,  \t et par K rapporte  12 points. </p>\t<p>\tOn appelle \\(S\\) la variable qui associe à chaque trajet le nombre\t de points qu'il rapporte.</p>\t <div class=\"wims_question\">\tDéterminer la loi de probabilité de \\(S\\).\t\t<table class=\"wimscenter wimsborder\"><tr><th>\\(s\\)</th><td> 0 </td><td> 3\t</td><td>4</td><td>8</td><td>12</td></tr>\t<tr><th>\\(P(S=s)\\)</th><td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td><td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td><td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td>\t<td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td><td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td></tr>\t</table>\t\tCalculer l'espérance mathématique de \\(S\\) : <label for=\"reply6\">\\(E{\\left(S \\right)} =\\)</label> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply6\" data-size=\"3\"></span><p>\tDéterminer le nombre de points à attribuer au passage en L\t pour avoir \\(E{\\left(S \\right)} = 3.65\\).</p>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"> <label for=\"reply7\">Nombre de points pour L :</label>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7\" data-size=\"3\"></span></div>\t<div class=\"wims_instruction\">Donner les valeurs exactes.</div>\t</div>\t",
